---
args: { targets: AmendmentTargetMap; effectiveDate: string; evidence: EvidencePage[] }
returns: AmendmentScopeMap
---
For each target bind the supported start and end date, covered entities and excluded transaction classes. Distinguish an explicit retroactive grant from prospective-only language and preserve unresolved alternatives. Overlapping amendments require signed precedence or a resolved condition; upload chronology alone is not authority. Return the effective map and every uncovered target or precedence question.